<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix Index</h2>

<div id="Ax1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="Ax1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Ax1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix <a href="#A1" title="Appendix A Additional Technical Notes ‣ Approximation Error Upper and Lower Bounds for Hölder Class with Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A</span></a> provides a summary table of notations for quick-reference, along with supplementary technical remarks.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix <a href="#A2" title="Appendix B Approximation Error Upper Bound ‣ Approximation Error Upper and Lower Bounds for Hölder Class with Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B</span></a> derives the error upper bound on the Hölder class and discusses the underlying theoretical assumptions.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix <a href="#A3" title="Appendix C Approximation Error Lower Bound ‣ Approximation Error Upper and Lower Bounds for Hölder Class with Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C</span></a> establishes the error lower bound by first analyzing the VC-dimension upper bound of Transformers.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Details of Applications in the Regression Task ‣ Approximation Error Upper and Lower Bounds for Hölder Class with Transformers" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a> details the application of our theory to the general regression task.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Additional Technical Notes</h2>

